# Build output and tool caches never belong in a build context: they are large, they belong to
# the host's libc, and a stale `dist/` would silently shadow the stage's own bundle.
**
!nodus-backend/
!recommender/
!sdk/
!server-sdk/
!web/
!deploy/
!rust-toolchain.toml

**/target/
**/target-bookworm/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/rust_out/
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/
**/.git/
